- 97: pierwsza -> 97 (1)
- 150: 150/2=75, 75/3=25, 25/5=5, 5/5=1 -> 2*3*5*5 (4)
- 72: 72/2=36, 36/2=18, 18/2=9, 9/3=3, 3/3=1 -> 2*2*2*3*3 (5)
